    "quality_rubric": {
      "reader_visibility": "All nine homogeneous reader/evidence classes execute against real readers; BLOCKED, proxy, static-only, local-preview-only, DOM-only, or AX-snapshot-only evidence never passes.",
      "preservation": "All 815 blocks, 113 authored header cells, 1374 body cells, 388 marks, every CCH29 nested-list word, and source preimage/digest are count- and hash-exact; exactly 11 intentionally headerless tables remain headerless.",
      "schema": "Recursive validation rejects or immutably quarantines malformed structures, unequal aliases, and ambiguous legacy forms without choosing precedence or inventing intent.",
      "geometry": "TUI lines are bounded at widths 1, 20, 40, 80, and 120; real public, Studio, Gmail, Outlook, and Apple Mail clients pass declared narrow-width, reflow, and long-token checks without clipping or authored loss.",
      "accessibility": "Real browser and delivered-reader checks prove headings, lists, tables, callouts, landmarks, reading order, labels, focus, and reflow; VoiceOver plus NVDA or an explicitly equivalent real assistive-technology pair must pass.",
      "interaction": "Mouse, keyboard focus, scroll ownership, click and Enter equivalence, selection state, history, Related, reconnect, session expiry, and recovery pass executable behavioral checks.",
      "platform_truth": "Typed 401, 404, 405, 406, 422, 500, and timeout behavior, request IDs, six identity domains, ETags, conditional requests, discovery, help/schema/OpenAPI, pagination, history limits, and perspective validation agree.",
      "mutation_safety": "Every source mutation requires the expected revision; passing paths perform no read-side mutation, allow no unfenced fallback, retain immutable quarantine evidence, and prove byte-exact rollback from captured preimage and digest.",
      "failure_integrity": "Observed counts for false not-found, silent scope or perspective substitution, silent secondary failure, retry-erased failure, identity conflation, terminal control leak, non-idempotence, rollback mismatch, and unfenced mutation are all exactly zero; no averaging is allowed.",
      "environment_preflight": "Before Diverge, authenticated Studio, deployed cache/reconnect, real Gmail/Outlook/Apple Mail delivery, real browser widths, VoiceOver plus NVDA or equivalent, and the complete five-width terminal harness each produce reproducible availability receipts.",
      "pilot": "One integrated candidate passes the full E10+E11+E12 hard-cell union twice with stable hashes and zero FAIL, BLOCKED, or proxy cells; three disjoint batches then pass within 1800 seconds each at error budget zero.",
      "no_winner": "Any FAIL, BLOCKED, proxy, unstable replay, missing real-reader cell, or positive hard-failure count forbids Pilot; if no candidate clears the complete union twice, the wave closes unsuccessful and is replaced."
